      "value": "<p>Your very skin shines in the noonday sun.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dances class feature, know the treasures of the deep earth dance, Wis 12, primordial dancer level 6th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you reflect a ray with the reflect ray active ability, the original attacker takes a -4 penalty to AC against that ray.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/primordial-dancer-feats#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
